# Compiler flags, by toolchain. MSVC is what this has always built with; the
# GCC/Clang arm is what an Emscripten build needs, and having it here is the
# difference between "not ported yet" and "the build actively prevents it".
#
# Nothing targets wasm yet. Portable common libraries no longer inherit a
# Windows constraint; the translated kernels and desktop hosts remain
# Windows-only until their own portability work lands.
